WEBVTT

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.650
Your belongings have arrived.

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.230
Thank you very much.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:01.590
How typical.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:14.620
An order telling me to poison the beast-lords here.

00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:38.380
An order to lead the light into darkness.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:58.650
Fly

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:02.220
Lilan flew?

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:04.750
Yes.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.750
Are you sure about this?

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.890
Yes.  She flew the sky freely like a wild beast-lord.

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:18.510
I was on her back, observing it happening.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:32.080
Erin, I had a feeling that this day would come.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:41.100
But, if Lilan can fly freely, wouldn't she run away from Kazalm?

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:43.960
I'm worried about that, too.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.500
You said you were on her back when you flew, right?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.220
Yes.

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:52.590
In that case, train Lilan.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.160
"Train?"

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:59.060
Yes.  Train her to fly only on your command.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:01.550
So that she won't fly on her own.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:07.900
The flight training will be kept only between us five.

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.440
You two especially, do you understand?

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.780
No problem!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.810
Yeah!

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.450
Esal-sensei.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:22.170
I'm very afraid of getting on Lilan's back.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:30.200
Great amounts of wind whip my body, so it feels like I'll get shaken off if I don't hold on with all my might.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:37.330
Don't worry.  Of course we'll think of a way so you can fly safely.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.240
Is what I asked for ready?

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:40.850
Big time!

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:41.880
It's ready!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:54.840
I won't kill you just yet.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.510
Man, it's so busy.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:10.290
Hey, you two.  I don't see Lilan in the cage, so is something going on?

00:05:11.150 --> 00:05:12.680
Yeah, we're going to-

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:16.730
Ani, you can't!  We're not allowed to tell anyone.

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:18.300
Oh, right.

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:22.380
Is something secret going on?

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:25.470
We've been told not to tell anyone.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:26.890
It's a secret.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:29.360
A secret, eh?

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.300
So I won't tell you no matter what.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.520
It's a secret promise.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:36.970
Here.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.020
I understand the situation.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:44.250
Flight training sounds interesting.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:49.870
Please keep this a secret from the other teachers and the students, as well.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:54.900
Please don't worry.  I know how to hold my tongue.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:01.040
Train her in that outfit.

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.500
It's been designed for flight training.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.320
We made it.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.910
Thank you.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.710
We redesigned the horse saddle.

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:17.510
It's pretty heavy.  Can you handle it yourself?

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:20.580
I'm the only one who can go near Lilan.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:21.570
I'll give it a try.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:35.480
Listen, Lilan.  This will let me fly with you.

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:36.730
Do you get it?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.430
That's right.  There's nothing scary about it.

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:44.180
I'm going to put this on you, and then get on top of it.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.790
Can you bend over?

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:50.680
Thank you, Lilan.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.080
Don't move, Lilan.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:18.630
Erin!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.050
Don't blow it!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:27.020
I'm fine.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:28.850
Little girl!

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:29.760
Erin-chan!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.000
Are you all right, Erin?!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:32.900
Yes.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.990
She must have been surprised since the saddle bit into her back.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.830
A horse saddle must not be a proper fit for a beast-lord.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.450
I'm sorry, Lilan.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:52.450
If we were to make a saddle from scratch, it would require a lot of time.

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:54.790
What should we do?

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:58.870
I don't think we'll be able to make one before the students come back from the break.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:04.590
I know.

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:06.630
How about using a futon saddle?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.500
"A futon saddle?"

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:14.550
A futon saddle is a type of horse saddle used in cold areas.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:18.070
It's shaped so it covers the entire back.

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:23.560
He's right.  A futon saddle might fit a beast-lord's back well.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.320
A guy I know in town owned a futon saddle if I'm right.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:29.660
Should I borrow that?

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.660
Yes, please.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.830
You're good, Lilan.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:42.380
There.

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:47.310
You really like playing with the ball, don't you?

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:58.320
You're really getting along with that beast-lord.

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.010
Don't come any closer.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.440
Please don't blow the mute whistle!

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.630
Just like before.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.450
You don't use this, do you?

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:15.740
No, I don't.

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:19.940
You're raising her without benetrophic water, too.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:25.080
Are you aware that you're going against the Beast-Lord Imperatives?

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:32.890
The reason why I was able to save Lilan without the use of benetrophic water and the mute whistle when she wasn't eating anything

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.600
was because I wasn't aware of the Beast-Lord Imperatives at the time.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:40.640
I'm only continuing what I started.

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:43.950
Esal-sensei has given me permission.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:48.540
"Beast-lords never befriend humans."

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.780
That's what I've always been taught.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.570
That's why I'm very interested.

00:09:56.750 --> 00:09:58.300
Interested in what you do.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.410
I saw it yesterday, too.

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:05.580
How Lilan flew with you on her back.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.020
It was a great sight.

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:27.580
It reminded me of the story of Je.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:37.680
In ancient times, when the ancestor of the Queen descended from Ephon Noha to Tahai Aze,

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:44.750
beast-lords, which never befriend humans, flew as if they were protecting the Founding Queen.

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:50.130
The people met the Founding Queen, Je, who had golden eyes.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.590
She was the holy Goddess Herself.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:10:58.870
I'm-

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.930
I want to see this through.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:06.440
I want to see if Lilan will listen to you and fly or not.

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.780
Chain Lilan down?!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:30.260
Yes.  A wounded beast-lord will be brought here soon.

00:11:30.970 --> 00:11:34.730
It'll be big trouble if they catch Lilan flying.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:38.560
Why?!  Lilan has never flown since!

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:41.490
I don't think she would fly away!

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:47.610
Erin, even if you two understand each other, you're still dealing with a beast.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:52.540
Understand?  You'll have to have her trained before the people from Lazal come.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.940
The futon saddle's here!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.340
Looks like the size fits well.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:15.100
She doesn't look like she's in pain, either.

00:12:16.720 --> 00:12:18.550
I think this will work.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.110
Yay!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.070
We're starting, Lilan.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.530
Lilan, start walking slowly.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:52.130
Don't look at me!  Walk slowly.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:59.010
Do you get it?  Walk slowly with me on your back, like horses do.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.400
Hey, Lilan!  Where are you going?!

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.580
She's playing.

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.960
Oh, Lilan...

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:30.070
There's no way a human and beast can get along.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:35.720
A bird in a cage can only live in a cage.

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.190
Tahya!

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:43.890
You can't clean the place when we're letting you stay here?

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.490
I'm sorry, madam.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.870
Tahya, hang in there for just a bit longer.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:58.830
Once I enter Tamuyuan, we won't need to be taken care of by Wajyaku.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.380
Really, Onii-sama?

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.420
A caged bird never has any freedom.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:12.230
We weren't allowed to live outside the cage.

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:21.690
That's how this world works.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.340
Tahya!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.030
Tahya!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.050
Tahya...

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.180
Lilan, walk down the hill and fly off.

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.170
Ready, Lilan?

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:52.530
Run!

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.890
Yes, keep that up!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.910
Fly off!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.400
Don't stop.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:08.150
Just like that, fly off.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:12.780
Spread your wings and flap them.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.560
No, not running!  You need to fly!

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:26.030
Yes, keep that up.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.700
Just like that!  Spread your wings.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:29.660
Fly!

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:05.440
Why won't she fly?

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.900
She understands my other words.

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.850
Why won't you, Lilan?

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:18.100
We'll get this right today.

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.580
Okay, anytime, Lilan.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:28.730
Lilan?

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:32.030
What are you doing, Lilan?  You have to fly.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.260
What's wrong, Lilan?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.000
You flew the other day!

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:47.440
I wonder how Lilan feels about the training.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:17:00.470
I can't understand Lilan's feelings.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:09.090
Looks like you're having lots of trouble.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.320
Kiriku-sensei.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:16.600
Beast-lords here are permitted limited freedom.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:19.360
It won't change no matter what you do.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.960
That's how this world works.

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:27.600
Anything that differs from the norm can't live in this world.

00:17:36.800 --> 00:17:40.790
<i>Beastinarians don't exist for the sake of the beasts.</i>

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:45.500
<i>We exist for the sake of the people who live with the beasts.</i>

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:57.480
Well anyway, give it your best shot.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.540
Mom.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:12.210
I want to raise Lilan like a wild beast-lord, not for the people's sake.

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:24.020
Not for the people's sake...

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.520
I was only giving orders.

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:33.810
I wasn't trying to listen to Lilan's feelings.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:54.110
All right, let's go outside!

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:57.680
See?

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.930
I'm sorry, Lilan.  You don't have to fly anymore.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:11.200
Let's train again when you want to fly.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.130
It feels so good.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.690
There's some great weather today, Lilan.

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:49.870
When I flew with you, it was cold and scary, but I was also very happy.

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:56.960
It felt like we became the wind.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.600
It felt like we could fly anywhere.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.230
It felt really good.

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.260
Lilan?

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:48.930
To chain Lilan down, we'll need a new pillar built.

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:50.200
You're right.

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:03.790
Let's go, Lilan!

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:11.130
Lilan.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:15.620
Lilan.

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.280
You want to fly, don't you?

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.940
I can tell!  I can feel it!

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:23.470
Lilan, fly!

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.500
A-A-Ani!

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.580
What?  You're so loud...

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:39.040
H-Holy cow!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.430
The little girl!

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:41.790
Erin-chan!

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:43.750
Look, look.

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:01.950
The beast-lord's...

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:04.720
Erin.

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:08.050
Erin-chan!  Erin-chan!

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:08.570
Little girl!
Erin-chan!  Erin-chan!

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.140
Little girl!

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:18.390
Erin felt Lilan's strong urge to fly.

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:26.200
And the fact that Erin was able to sense that urge was what made Erin most happy.

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:07.500
The beast-lord being treated for its
wounds becomes weak overnight.

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:12.030
A flower-like sweet scent can be found on the beast-lord's breath.

00:24:12.030 --> 00:24:13.900
It's the scent of chichi mimic.

00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:18.760
In search of an antidote, I make my way to the capital.

00:24:18.760 --> 00:24:21.970
Along the way, I meet him again.

00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:25.090
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Ial and Erin.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:26:00.070
Ial and Erin
